# Keep the Docker build context small + reproducible: exclude VCS metadata,
# Gradle/build outputs, IDE files, local caches and relayBench's corpora. The
# build stage runs a fresh `./gradlew :geode:installDist` inside the image, so
# nothing under any build/ directory needs to travel with the context.
.git
.github
**/build/
.gradle/
**/.gradle/
.idea/
*.iml
.kotlin/
**/.kotlin/
local.properties
relayBench/.cache/
relayBench/.corpus-cache/
relayBench/results/
